{"id":"d12aec25b5426f2f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-bounded-truth-table.md","title":"有界真值表归约与范数","display":"df-bounded-truth-table — 有界真值表归约与范数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-bounded-truth-table","aliases":["20-df-bounded-truth-table"],"display":"df-bounded-truth-table — 有界真值表归约与范数","chapter":"5","section":"5.3.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Exercise 5.3.15 的定义","source_printed_pages":[117],"source_pdf_pages":[152],"depends_on":["[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-truth-table]]","[[20-df-mred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-bounded-truth-table"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-bounded-truth-table</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-truth-table — 有界真值表归约与范数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 5.3.15 的定义"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>117</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_y\">\\(D_y\\)</span> 是规范有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为全可计算函数族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}\\)</span> 记所定义的二元关系。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded-truth-table}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{BTT}(A,B,n):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall x\\ \\left[|D_{f(x)}|\\le n\\land\n(x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\in D_{g(x)}\\ [B\\cap D_{f(x)}=D_y])\\right],\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}B:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n\\ \\operatorname{BTT}(A,B,n).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded-truth-table}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{BTT}(A,B,n):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall x\\ \\left[|D_{f(x)}|\\le n\\land\n(x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\in D_{g(x)}\\ [B\\cap D_{f(x)}=D_y])\\right],\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}B:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n\\ \\operatorname{BTT}(A,B,n).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{f(x)}\">\\(D_{f(x)}\\)</span> 是预先计算的查询集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{g(x)}\">\\(D_{g(x)}\\)</span> 是接受的有限答案模式之规范码集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in D_{g(x)}\">\\(y\\in D_{g(x)}\\)</span> 的类型是一个自然数有限集码，再解码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_y\">\\(D_y\\)</span>。任何虚假答案模式也有定义好的接受或拒绝结果，故这是 tt 归约。范数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 统一界定每个输入的查询个数，不界定被查询自然数的大小；不要与 bT 的 use 上界混用。</p>\n<p>若把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的有限查询集改写为前缀表，取长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>（空查询）或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1+\\max D_{f(x)}\">\\(1+\\max D_{f(x)}\\)</span>，对每个完整二进制答案按上述有限判据输出，即得本目录的 tt 定义。范数为零时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算，因为没有任何 oracle 查询。m 归约的一个查询及接受模式可直接写入此式。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 117 / PDF 152。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"202d3cae13e0389b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-truth-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"202d3cae13e0389b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"D_y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded-truth-table}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{BTT}(A,B,n):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall x\\ \\left[|D_{f(x)}|\\le n\\land\n(x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\in D_{g(x)}\\ [B\\cap D_{f(x)}=D_y])\\right],\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{btt}}B:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n\\ \\operatorname{BTT}(A,B,n).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"D_{f(x)}","display":false},{"tex":"D_{g(x)}","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in D_{g(x)}","display":false},{"tex":"D_y","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1+\\max D_{f(x)}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2096,"backlinks":[{"id":"eedc97021295284c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。"},{"id":"bd629931e1dcac96","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"}],"outgoing":["59004ac6d23e86f8","e343870c773cb68e","202d3cae13e0389b","d5dada982b721c80"]}